// Without `As`, a module's names are introduced as written; a module may be used before its declaration in the same block, and a module's own `Use`s expand with it.
Fact person Identified by P
Use greeting(person)
Module greeting(who) {
  Act greet Actor who Creates greeted(who) Holds when True
  Fact greeted Identified by who
}
.
greet(P).
?greeted(P).
